        {
            "heading": "Rediscovering a Pimlico Landmark",
            "paragraphs": [
                "Discover the story of one of Pimlico's most recognisable civic buildings. Formerly home to Pimlico Library, this mid-century landmark is being transformed into a new community hub. Explore its history, learn about its role within the Lillington Gardens estate, and find out how this much-loved building will continue serving residents as a vibrant centre for community activity and local connection."
            ]
